Lo, as a careful huswife runs to catch
One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch as a careful huswife runs to catch
One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch,
To find the stanzas that flatter your heart's own.
The beast that brings you scant cheer,
A faithful companion to her, you lend
Faith, and makes whole your being whole anew.
Beware, though plentiful in your abundance,
Of Bagdad's gold, for it lies in thee
And he, in abundance, takes all
