Lo, as a careful huswife runs to catch
One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch as a careful huswife runs to catch
One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch,
To keep him from stray thoughts, while she pursues
The trail of blame, which she will not cease.
So you, like a devoted mother, keep alive
Your unspoken wish, while awaiting your return,
With joy in your heart, your love constant,
As if it's waiting for you, unbound.
Unyielding to the whispers of mistrust,
You silently guard, while others plot,
Your heart laid bare, no longer veiled.
  For I watch while others mar with words,
  And you, in silence, mingle.


