So, now I have confessed that he is thine
And I myself am mortgaged to thy will,
Myself I'll forfeit, so that other mine now I have confessed that he is thine
And I myself am mortgaged to thy will,
Myself I'll forfeit, so that other mine
May benefit by thy services alone.
That is why I have recourse to disguise my stand,
To make him seem less harsh than I am inclined,
And to some other pass amiss
Than I by thy side should prove amiss,
And to thee I send this written embassage
