Lo, as a careful huswife runs to catch
One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch as a careful huswife runs to catch
One of her feathered creatures broke away,
Sets down her babe, and makes all swift dispatch,
Bending Time's spoils with ease,
Anon permit the basest clouds to ride
With ugly rack on his celestial face,
And from the forlorn world his visage hide,
Stealing unseen to west with this disgrace.
So flatter I the swart complexioned here,
And with my forlorn thoughts do render me disgrace,
And worse essays prove thee my best of love.
  For nothing this wide universe I call,
  Save thou, my rose; in it thou art my all.


