So, now I have confessed that he is thine
And I myself am mortgaged to thy will,
Myself I'll forfeit, so that other mine now I have confessed that he is thine
And I myself am mortgaged to thy will,
Myself I'll forfeit, so that other mine is in another place.
Thou art as collateral, and therefore to thee I'll keep,
Unless my nerves were brass or hammered steel,
